#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:4
msgid "分类模型 (Classification)"
msgstr "Classification model (Classification)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:7
msgid "本页面介绍DaoAI World模型的图像分类类型。返回 :ref:`DaoAI World模型主页 <DaoAI World模型>`"
msgstr ""
"This page introduces the image classification types of DaoAI World "
"model.Return :ref:`DaoAI World model homepage <DaoAI World model>`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:10
msgid "模型简介"
msgstr "Model introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:12
msgid ""
"分类模型用于对整张图像进行类别判断，为图像分配一个或多个类别标签及其对应的置信度分数。与目标检测不同，分类模型不输出物体的位置信息，而是对整体图像内容进行识别。"
msgstr ""
"The classification model is used to judge the category of the entire image "
"and assign one or more category labels and their corresponding confidence "
"scores to the image.Different from target detection, the classification "
"model does not output the location information of the object, but identifies"
" the overall image content."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:15
msgid "适用场景"
msgstr "Applicable scenarios"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:17
msgid "图像分类模型适用于以下场景："
msgstr ""
"The image classification model is suitable for the following scenarios:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:19
msgid "**质量检测**：良品/不良品分类、缺陷类型识别"
msgstr ""
"**Quality Inspection**: Classification of good/defective products, "
"identification of defect types"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:20
msgid "**医疗影像**：病症分类、X光片诊断辅助"
msgstr ""
"**Medical Imaging**: Disease classification, X-ray diagnostic assistance"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:21
msgid "**内容审核**：图片内容分类、不当内容识别"
msgstr ""
"**Content review**: Image content classification, inappropriate content "
"identification"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:22
msgid "**场景识别**：室内/室外、白天/夜晚等场景分类"
msgstr ""
"**Scene recognition**: Indoor/outdoor, day/night, etc. scene classification"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:23
msgid "**产品识别**：产品型号识别、品牌识别"
msgstr ""
"**Product identification**: product model identification, brand "
"identification"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:24
msgid "**动植物识别**：物种分类、品种鉴定"
msgstr ""
"**Animal and plant identification**: species classification, variety "
"identification"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:27
msgid "输出格式"
msgstr "Output format"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:29
msgid "分类模型的输出为JSON格式，包含预测的类别及置信度："
msgstr ""
"The output of the classification model is in JSON format, including the "
"predicted category and confidence:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:31
msgid "**单标签分类输出：**"
msgstr "**Single label classification output:**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:54
msgid "**多标签分类输出：**"
msgstr "**Multi-label classification output:**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:76
msgid "**字段说明：**"
msgstr "**Field description:**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:78
msgid "``predictions``: 所有类别的预测结果（按置信度降序排列）"
msgstr ""
"``predictions``: prediction results for all categories (in descending order "
"of confidence)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:79
msgid "``class``: 类别名称"
msgstr "``class``: category name"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:80
msgid "``confidence``: 该类别的置信度（0~1）"
msgstr "``confidence``: the confidence of this category (0~1)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:81
msgid "``top_class``: 置信度最高的类别（单标签分类）"
msgstr ""
"``top_class``: the class with the highest confidence (single-label "
"classification)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:82
msgid "``top_confidence``: 最高置信度值（单标签分类）"
msgstr ""
"``top_confidence``: highest confidence value (single label classification)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:83
msgid "``active_labels``: 超过阈值的所有标签（多标签分类）"
msgstr ""
"``active_labels``: all labels exceeding the threshold (multi-label "
"classification)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:86
msgid "配置示例"
msgstr "Configuration example"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:88
msgid "**基础单标签分类**"
msgstr "**Basic single label classification**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:99
msgid "**多标签分类配置**"
msgstr "**Multi-label classification configuration**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:117
msgid "**质量检测应用**"
msgstr "**Quality Inspection Application**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:133
msgid "使用技巧与最佳实践"
msgstr "Tips and best practices"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:135
msgid "**置信度阈值设置**"
msgstr "**Confidence threshold setting**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:137
msgid "**单标签分类**：建议0.5-0.7，可直接使用top_class"
msgstr ""
"**Single label classification**: 0.5-0.7 is recommended, top_class can be "
"used directly"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:138
msgid "**多标签分类**：建议0.6-0.8，避免过多误判标签"
msgstr ""
"**Multi-label classification**: 0.6-0.8 is recommended to avoid too many "
"misjudged labels"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:139
msgid "**质量检测**：建议0.8-0.95，确保高精度"
msgstr "**Quality Inspection**: Recommended 0.8-0.95 to ensure high accuracy"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:141
msgid "**处理不确定结果**"
msgstr "**Handling Uncertain Results**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:143
msgid "当top_confidence < 0.5时，建议标记为\"不确定\"或进行人工复核"
msgstr ""
"When top_confidence < 0.5, it is recommended to mark it as \"uncertain\" or "
"perform manual review"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:144
msgid "可设置多个置信度区间，执行不同的后续操作"
msgstr ""
"Multiple confidence intervals can be set to perform different follow-up "
"operations"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:146
msgid "**类别不平衡处理**"
msgstr "**Category imbalance processing**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:148
msgid "对少数类别降低阈值以提高召回率"
msgstr "Lower the threshold for minority classes to improve recall"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:149
msgid "对关键类别提高阈值以确保精确度"
msgstr "Raise thresholds on key categories to ensure accuracy"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:151
msgid "**性能优化**"
msgstr "**Performance Optimization**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:153
msgid "分类模型通常比检测模型更快，适合实时应用"
msgstr ""
"Classification models are generally faster than detection models and "
"suitable for real-time applications"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:154
msgid "批量处理可显著提升吞吐量"
msgstr "Batch processing significantly improves throughput"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:156
msgid "**图像预处理**"
msgstr "**Image preprocessing**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:158
msgid "确保输入图像质量良好（清晰度、光照）"
msgstr "Make sure the input image quality is good (sharpness, lighting)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:159
msgid "保持与训练数据相似的图像风格和分辨率"
msgstr "Maintain image style and resolution similar to the training data"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:162
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "FAQ"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:164
msgid "**Q: 分类结果的所有类别置信度加起来等于1吗？**"
msgstr ""
"**Q: Does the sum of the confidence levels of all categories in the "
"classification results equal 1?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:166
msgid "A: 对于单标签分类（使用softmax），所有类别置信度之和为1。对于多标签分类（使用sigmoid），每个类别独立计算，总和不一定为1。"
msgstr ""
"A: For single-label classification (using softmax), the sum of all class "
"confidences is 1.For multi-label classification (using sigmoid), each "
"category is calculated independently and does not necessarily sum to 1."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:168
msgid "**Q: 如何判断模型对结果的确定程度？**"
msgstr "**Q: How to judge how certain the model is about the results?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:170
msgid "A: 查看 ``top_confidence`` 值："
msgstr "A: Check the ``top_confidence`` value:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:172
msgid "> 0.9：高度确定"
msgstr "> 0.9: Highly certain"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:173
msgid "0.7-0.9：较为确定"
msgstr "0.7-0.9: relatively certain"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:174
msgid "0.5-0.7：中等确定"
msgstr "0.5-0.7: Moderately certain"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:175
msgid "< 0.5：不确定，建议复核"
msgstr "< 0.5: Unsure, it is recommended to review"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:177
msgid "**Q: 图像中有多个物体时，分类结果是什么？**"
msgstr ""
"**Q: What is the classification result when there are multiple objects in "
"the image?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:179
msgid "A: 分类模型对整张图像进行分类，通常会输出最显著物体的类别或整体场景的类别。如需识别多个物体，建议使用目标检测模型。"
msgstr ""
"A: A classification model classifies the entire image, usually outputting "
"the category of the most salient object or the category of the overall "
"scene.If you need to recognize multiple objects, it is recommended to use "
"the object detection model."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:181
msgid "**Q: 可以同时输出多个类别吗？**"
msgstr "**Q: Can multiple categories be output at the same time?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:183
msgid "A: 可以。这取决于模型训练方式："
msgstr "A: Yes.This depends on how the model is trained:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:185
msgid "**单标签分类**：只选择置信度最高的一个类别"
msgstr ""
"**Single label classification**: Only select the category with the highest "
"confidence"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:186
msgid "**多标签分类**：可输出多个超过阈值的类别"
msgstr ""
"**Multi-label classification**: multiple categories that exceed the "
"threshold can be output"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:189
msgid "应用案例"
msgstr "Application cases"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:191
msgid "**案例1：工业质检**"
msgstr "**Case 1: Industrial quality inspection**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:193
msgid "对生产线产品进行良品/不良品分类，并识别缺陷类型。"
msgstr ""
"Classify production line products as good/defective and identify defect "
"types."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:209
msgid "工作流逻辑："
msgstr "Workflow logic:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:211
msgid "如果输出为 \"good\" 且 confidence > 0.8，则通过检测"
msgstr "The detection passes if the output is \"good\" and confidence > 0.8"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:212
msgid "如果输出为缺陷类型且 confidence > 0.9，则标记为不良品"
msgstr ""
"If the output is defect type and confidence > 0.9, mark it as defective"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:213
msgid "如果所有 confidence < 0.8，则转人工复核"
msgstr "If all confidences < 0.8, switch to manual review"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:215
msgid "**案例2：场景识别**"
msgstr "**Case 2: Scene Recognition**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:217
msgid "识别图像中的多个场景属性（多标签分类）。"
msgstr ""
"Identify multiple scene attributes in images (multi-label classification)."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:233
msgid "输出示例：``[\"outdoor\", \"urban\", \"daytime\", \"crowded\"]``"
msgstr "Output example: ``[\"outdoor\", \"urban\", \"daytime\", \"crowded\"]``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:235
msgid "**案例3：医疗影像辅助诊断**"
msgstr "**Case 3: Medical imaging-assisted diagnosis**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:237
msgid "对医学影像进行病症分类，辅助医生诊断。"
msgstr "Classify medical images to assist doctors in diagnosis."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_classification.rst:253
msgid "医疗应用需要设置极高的置信度阈值，且结果仅供参考，不能替代专业医生诊断。"
msgstr ""
"Medical applications need to set extremely high confidence thresholds, and "
"the results are for reference only and cannot replace the diagnosis of "
"professional doctors."

